message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite both the repository (below) and the
  accompanying manuscript (preferred-citation).
title: >-
  Coupling between dendritic arborization and intrinsic membrane physiology
  in the released mouse and human reconstructions of the Allen Cell Types
  Database
authors:
  - family-names: Sriwicha
    given-names: Phongsakon
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-0561-1076"
