      King Mongkut's University of Technology Thonburi (KMUTT),
      Bangkok, Thailand
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-04"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ItsTongKung/allen-morphophysiology"
identifiers:
  - description: Zenodo archive of this repository
    type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23135429"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python analysis code accompanying a secondary analysis of
  publicly released mouse and human cortical neuron morphology and intrinsic
  electrophysiology from the Allen Cell Types Database. The pipeline
  re-derives arborization morphometrics from the released SWC reconstructions
  (including axon geometry, per-cell Sholl profiles, and an apical/basal
  compartment split), links them to the released electrophysiological
  features cell-by-cell with the donor as the unit of inference, and
  quantifies how sampling composition and morphological range shape the
  apparent species differences in morphology-physiology coupling.
keywords:
  - Allen Cell Types Database
  - neuronal morphology
  - electrophysiology
  - dendrites
  - Sholl analysis
  - cross-species comparison
  - reproducibility
